.TH TOON-MCP 1 "March 2026" "toon-mcp 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
toon-mcp \- FastMCP server for Token-Optimized Object Notation (TOON)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B toon-mcp
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B toon-mcp
is a pure Python FastMCP server providing high-efficiency Token-Optimized Object Notation (TOON) compression, decompression, pattern analysis, and token savings metrics for LLM contexts.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show summary of options.
.TP
.BR \-\-version
Show version information.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR toon-wrap (1),
.BR mcp (1)
